OL,3,GNEWSAFarewell to independent
OL,4,Asupermarket after 78 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor shoppers in the seaside town of
OL,7,FScarborough, Proudfoot is a name that
OL,8,Fhas been known for generations.
OL,10,FSunday marked the final day of trading
OL,11,Ffor three grocery stores that have been
OL,12,Fsold to Tesco, reducing the high street
OL,13,Fpresence of a brand that has been a
OL,14,Fgo-to for nearly 80 years.
OL,16,FThe closure of the shops at Newby,
OL,17,FManham Hill and Seamer means that
OL,18,FProudfoot now retains only its
OL,19,FEastfield site.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
