OL,3,GNEWSAFarewell to independent
OL,4,Asupermarket after 78 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA director at the firm said the
OL,7,Fdecision had been "carefully
OL,8,Fconsidered" and expressed thanks to
OL,9,Fcustomers, staff and suppliers.
